; =============================================================================
; BIND RFC 1035 Zone File for omnicodestudio.com
; CreativeWorkzStudio LLC — OmniCode Platform Infrastructure
; Compatible with Cloudflare DNS Zone File Import (DNS -> Records -> Import)
; =============================================================================
$ORIGIN omnicodestudio.com.
$TTL 3600

; =============================================================================
; 1. PRIMARY WEB STUDIO & REST API (HTTP/HTTPS - Port 8080)
; =============================================================================
; Option A: Cloudflare Zero Trust Named Tunnel (Recommended)
; Tunnel ID: c346aa27-b4c1-41ba-815c-f66b2b84243b
; Benefits: Free SSL certificates, zero open firewall ports, DDoS mitigation.
@       IN  CNAME   c346aa27-b4c1-41ba-815c-f66b2b84243b.cfargotunnel.com.
www     IN  CNAME   c346aa27-b4c1-41ba-815c-f66b2b84243b.cfargotunnel.com.
studio  IN  CNAME   c346aa27-b4c1-41ba-815c-f66b2b84243b.cfargotunnel.com.
api     IN  CNAME   c346aa27-b4c1-41ba-815c-f66b2b84243b.cfargotunnel.com.

; Option B: Direct Oracle Cloud Compute 24/7 Instance (IP: 147.224.147.30)
; If routing directly to the Oracle VM rather than Cloudflare Tunnel, use these:
; @       IN  A       147.224.147.30
; www     IN  CNAME   omnicodestudio.com.
cloud   IN  A       147.224.147.30
vm      IN  A       147.224.147.30

; =============================================================================
; 2. CREATIVEWORKZSTUDIO LLC LOCAL GATEWAY & WORKSTATION (IP: 71.11.99.168)
; =============================================================================
; Points to CreativeWorkzStudio LLC primary gateway / local staging engine
local   IN  A       71.11.99.168
gateway IN  A       71.11.99.168

; =============================================================================
; 3. DYNAMIC DNS (DuckDNS) FALLBACK ALIASES
; =============================================================================
; Dynamic CNAME mappings to licensed DuckDNS host (omnicodestudio.duckdns.org)
duck    IN  CNAME   omnicodestudio.duckdns.org.
edge    IN  CNAME   omnicodestudio.duckdns.org.

; =============================================================================
; 4. UNIFIED PLATFORM CROSS-LINKS (Yu-Gi-Oh! Server & Simulator)
; =============================================================================
; Live duel simulator on Oracle VM (Raw TCP Port 7911 / HTTP Port 7922)
; NOTE: In Cloudflare Dashboard, play/sim MUST remain DNS-Only (Grey Cloud) for TCP
cards   IN  CNAME   c346aa27-b4c1-41ba-815c-f66b2b84243b.cfargotunnel.com.
play    IN  A       147.224.147.30
sim     IN  A       147.224.147.30
